t next sign-in checked — this is the default and it must not be disabled.\n\n### Visual Inspection Report (Image 4 (inline, following the text above)) [Confidence: 0.80 / Medium]:\nThe image shows a screenshot of a password reset page for an employee named J. Employee, with a temporary password provided and a button to generate a new one.\n\n*   **Reset Password - J. Employee**\n    *   The title of the page is \"Reset Password - J. Employee\".\n    *   The page has a white background with black text.\n    *   There is a blue button that says \"Generate Temporary Password\" at the bottom of the page.\n*   **Temporary password**\n    *   The temporary password is displayed in a text box.\n    *   The password is \"Tq7#mVr2IkLp9x\".\n    *   There is a checkbox next to the password that says \"Force change at next sign-in\".\n*   **Generate Temporary Password**\n    *   The button is blue and has white text.\n    *   When clicked, it will generate a new temporary password for the user.\n\n**Summary:**\n\nThe image shows a password reset page for an employee named J. Employee, with a temporary password provided and a button to generate a new one. The page has a white background with black text, and the temporary password is displayed in a text box with a checkbox next to it. The button to generate a new temporary password is blue and has white text.\n\n**Detailed Description:**\n\n*   The page has a white background with black text.\n*   The title of the page is \"Reset Password - J. Employee\".\n*   The temporary password is displayed in a text box.\n*   The password is \"Tq7#mVr2IkLp9x\".\n*   There is a checkbox next to the password that says \"Force change at next sign-in\".\n*   The button to generate a new temporary password is blue and has white text.\n\n**Extracted Text:**\n\n*   Reset Password - J. Employee\n*   Temporary password: Tq7#mVr2IkLp9x\n*   Force change at next sign-in\n*   Generate Temporary Password\n\n**Errors and Warnings:**\n\n*   None visible\